# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day31

## Topic
# 접속사 vs 전치사
### Conjunction / Preposition

---

## 1. 가장 중요한 차이

접속사 뒤에는

→ **주어 + 동사**

전치사 뒤에는

→ **명사 / 동명사**

가 온다.

---

## 2. because vs because of

### because + 주어 + 동사

The meeting was canceled **because it rained**.

→ 비가 왔기 때문에 회의가 취소되었다.

### because of + 명사

The meeting was canceled **because of the rain**.

→ 비 때문에 회의가 취소되었다.

---

## 3. although vs despite

### although + 주어 + 동사

Although **it was raining**, we went outside.

### despite + 명사 / 동명사

Despite **the rain**, we went outside.

Despite **being tired**, she continued working.

---

## 4. while vs during

### while + 주어 + 동사

I read a book **while I was waiting**.

### during + 명사

I read a book **during the meeting**.

---

## 5. TOEIC 핵심

| 표현 | 뒤에 오는 것 |
|---|---|
| because | S + V |
| because of | 명사 / 동명사 |
| although | S + V |
| despite | 명사 / 동명사 |
| while | S + V |
| during | 명사 |

---

## 6. 자주 나오는 함정

❌ because of it was raining

✅ because it was raining

❌ despite it was raining

✅ despite the rain

✅ despite the fact that it was raining

---

## Quick Test

_____ the heavy rain, the event continued.

A. Although
B. Because
C. Despite
D. While

Answer: C

→ 뒤에 명사(the heavy rain)
→ despite
